WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:36.030
My name is Kurata Sana, first year
middle school student.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:39.120
Aoki - Award winning author, Mama,
the squirrel is Maro-chan.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.330
My manager and driver Rei-kun,
also my ex-boyfriend.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:46.120
- The mysterious white bat Babbit.
- Momandai is Cantonese.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:50.380
Hayama Akito, a passionate lone
wolf, has always been my friend.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.300
Matsui Fuka, I met her in the bathroom, she's my friend with a western accent.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:00.180
Akito! Are you really Hayama Akito?!

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.720
What does she want to do anyway?

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.680
Yeah, that's right.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.940
Because of you...

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.610
Because of you, my life became
really screwed up!!

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:21.490
The First Kiss
Ruined My Life

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.200
Huh!

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.750
He's the person
who stole my first kiss!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.370
Evil guy!

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.040
Get away, bra-less.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.500
Right.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.300
That's right, it's this face.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:40.180
I've always wanted to slap you.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.890
You are...

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.060
Yeah, remember me now?

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.140
Who are you?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.730
Who do you think you're kidding?!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.690
Ah! Akito-kun! Time to go home!

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.360
I remember now, those glasses!

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.860
Fuka-chan!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.580
The one who went to Osaka,
Fuka-chan?

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.950
I remember now.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:07.830
Buka!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.500
Who's Buka?!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.210
Fuka-chan's turned into a bit of a nag.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.670
You and me are enemies.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.340
It's all your fault,
my life is messed up!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.760
What are you going to do about it?!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.340
Hey, excuse me...
everybody's old friends here...

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:25.300
it seems like I'm the only one
that's been locked out of the little house.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:28.930
It's better to say you're outside
in the mosquito net...

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.520
Like this! Do you understand?

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.520
That happened in kindergarten.
It was a mistake.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:37.530
How can it have ruined your life?
That's ridiculous.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.740
Kindergarten? Did you say
kindergarten?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:42.490
It is very ridiculous, you idiot!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.950
You're the one who's ruined me!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.950
Shut up... Why are you getting all worked up over something so stupid?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.830
It's not stupid!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.370
It was really important to me!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.960
That's right, Aki. Maybe I don't know what happened, but you're taking it too lightly.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.210
Shut up, now there are two annoying women...

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.840
We heard you!
Aki! Try saying that again!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.670
Trying to escape? Wait!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.340
Running away won't save you, Aki!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.760
Step aside.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.350
Mess up!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.890
Wait up! Aki!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.100
How could he have escaped so fast?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.020
Every time I see his face
I get so mad.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.270
Fuka, cool down.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.690
So Fuka and Hayama went to the same kindergarten?

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.240
Yeah, yeah, I did too.
Hikari kindergarten.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.610
Aki caught me off guard then and
suddenly kissed me!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:29.080
Ehh... but it was in kindergarten,
can't you remember it as cute and no big deal?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.750
Yeah, that's true.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:36.710
Mine was last year...
I still feel it...

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.960
True, back then I thought it was no big deal.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.180
Pretended it was like saliva
touching a bee.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.510
I forgot all about it when
I moved to Osaka.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:52.270
But then came sixth grade and
everyone was talking about their first kiss.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.350
- People talk about that there, right?
- Yeah...

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:59.190
I remember when I was talking
about it with my friends...

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:04.900
It says the average age for
the first kiss is 16.4 years old!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.280
Is that true?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.910
That's hard to believe.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.120
When I get to that
age I will too...

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.160
Fuka, I bet I know who you'd like to
give you your first kiss...

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.080
Yeah... Takaishi-kun?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.790
Ah, you're annoying!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.880
Wait...

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.380
What's wrong, Fuka?

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:26.760
Actually...
I've already had my first kiss!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.970
What?

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.850
I already liked someone then.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.100
Takaishi-kun was in the same
class as me.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.480
We got along really well with each other.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.190
I was waiting for him to tell me
that he liked me.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.440
But the rumor about my first kiss
got out...

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.610
...and who knew Takaishi-kun
would move to another city!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.090
That's terrible.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.460
To have had the first kiss already
at this age.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.050
He must think I'm ludicrous!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.420
Ludicrous?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.640
But I'm pure!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.930
But regardless,
he went to Tokyo anyway.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.810
Over, over, over!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.320
Back then I had a life plan.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.740
Where did that chart come from?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.110
Matsui Fuka! Begin timing!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.910
Elementary school graduation,
Takaishi tells me he likes me.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:36.910
11 years old, we go out.
12 years old, we kiss for the first time.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.630
23 years old, I quit work and
get married at the palace.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:45.130
But then Aki messed this all up!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.510
It's so sad! I feel so bad for you!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:50.090
This is too sad,
it's all Hayama's fault.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.260
Thanks, Sana.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.680
But don't worry...

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:57.140
Since I can see him in school every day,
I don't have to be in a hurry.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.560
In these 3 years,
I will get my revenge.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.110
Akito-kun!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.360
About that kiss in kindergarten...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:15.830
...don't tell her it was for
money, even if it kills you!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.700
Fuka-chan is really, really mad.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.580
It's because she had someone
she liked at another school.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.670
A really long time ago.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:29.880
Kindergarten again today, boring.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.850
Hey Aki, listen, listen!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:38.270
Yunchi's mom
and dad kissed yesterday!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.850
Are you guys stupid?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.230
Kissing between couples is normal.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.940
Aki, so have you kissed
anyone before?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.860
No, but I could do it.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.150
No way!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.780
So if I do it, you'll give me
10 yen each?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.450
Sure, but I bet you can't do it!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.910
Buka, Buka.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.870
My name is not Buka, it's Fuka!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.870
Who cares, just come.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:03.000
- Aki, where are we going?
- Don't worry about it.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.350
Later.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.230
How is it? I did it.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.560
He did it!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.480
Now everyone, cough up 10 yen each.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.270
Wait! Hey! You bastard!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.190
Now I remember, I did end up making
money from it.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.610
From the 60 yen I got...

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.580
...I played slippery monster ball
three times...

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.660
Probably shouldn't say that.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.750
Are you trying to fool me?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.790
It's true, it's true,
Fuka and I are a lot alike.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.130
I understand the meaning
of best friends now!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.880
It's so great!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.010
Really?

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:57.600
I'm really happy to be
in middle school!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.430
I have more good news to tell you.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.890
What? What?

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:06.060
Sorry, the cast has been decided
on a movie.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.560
It's the work of that hot director, Ono Mikio.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.940
- You're the star of it!
- Yeah?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.650
What, you're not happy?

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.700
This great thing happened and
you're not happy?

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.370
Really? Great, great, that's really
exciting news.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.370
Isn't it, isn't it, isn't it?!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:24.790
The competition was really high.
This decision is really good.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.620
I'm such a great manager!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:31.300
But I guess Hayama really is a kiss devil.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.220
We don't have time to care about Hayama!

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.180
After all the hard work, I'm
finally making a name for myself.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.550
Hail! To the great manager!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.850
If you want people to praise you,
just say so Rei-kun.

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.890
{}Zenjiro's Kodocha

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.560
Sana-chan's gonna star in a movie
again?

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.900
Wow... really?

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.190
It's been decided.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:53.440
Of course!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:56.490
If you need a ghost from hell
to come out, just ask me!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.450
Yeah. Well, it's been decided!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:01.200
That's right, everybody loves to
look at strong muscles!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.240
Sana-chan, you've become
very strong.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.620
I have special powers to raise my
concentration!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.080
It's nice to see that you're taking
it so seriously. Sana-chan!

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.670
Sometimes! Really only sometimes.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.170
This only happens once in a while!
I can do it every half a year!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.760
The other half a year,
I barely get by.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.340
Sana-chan is really...

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:20.720
Wait, wait...

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.760
I haven't started acting yet!
That was just a prologue!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.100
Wait, let me talk some more
before the curtain closes!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.730
Wait! Don't close it!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.020
Wait!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.270
Really loud voice...

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.440
Hayama...

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:38.070
Haven't seen you all day...
Hmm? What do you wanna say?

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.360
It's about yesterday's incident.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:44.830
Are you talking about the fact that
you're still a kiss devil?

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.540
That's not it!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:47.960
Then what?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:51.790
What happened in kindergarten and
last year... it's not the same.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:55.880
I can't hear you. If you've got
something to say, can't you say it louder?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.420
It's nothing.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.260
Geez, you're a nice guy as a friend...

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:04.350
But as a guy, you give people headaches.
You make people angry.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:07.020
You're kidding me.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.270
You're one to talk.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.390
You're a failure at being a woman!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.690
You bra-less brat!

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.900
Eh, what's your name?

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.860
What your name is, what does that
have to do with anything?

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.240
We'll stop right here.
Time to go to class!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.160
See ya later, kiss devil!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.620
Hey, bra-less!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.780
What?

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.200
That's all you wanted to say?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.790
I wanted to tell you that I'm gonna
star in a movie.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.870
Women's enemy!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.050
Irritated...

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:45.970
{parte b}

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.760
Word beginning with Mu.

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.010
The answer is irritated.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:50.310
Insert Sana-chan's drawing song.
Prepare paper and crayon.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:54.310
First you draw one mountain...
then comes the water...

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:58.440
there goes 2 cups...
plus 2 earlobes...

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:02.570
butterfly, butterfly fly over here...
you've also grown a tail on your butt...

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:06.660
drawing on the left, drawing on
the right... draw the arrow shaped eye...

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.950
and then another arrow for
the other eye...

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.870
then add two of the wooden horses...

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:17.040
plus 6 round eyes...

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.130
and there it is,
Sana-chan's done!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.380
Jump, jump... Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.010
And this is my picture!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.680
Sorry about bringing this onto you
suddenly.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:28.640
Please continue watching.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.430
Let's begin homeroom.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.600
Akito-kun... homeroom has already
started.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.360
He looks like he's in a really bad
mood...

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:48.530
Hey Hayama... How dare you come to
class late acting like that?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.700
Put the trashcan back where it was.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.160
You're Hayama Akito, right?

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:57.000
So quickly, you're already showing
your arrogance.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.630
I heard you caused a lot of problems
when you were in elementary school...

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:08.300
...but I won't allow that to
happen in my middle school class...

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.680
...so be prepared!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.220
This should be fun.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.560
What?

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.390
Akito-kun!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:18.110
If he sees anybody he doesn't like,
he'd just torture them even more.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:23.650
I understand teachers are people
too.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:24.990
What?

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.700
Sensei, sorry!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.580
Hayama-kun is emotionally,
no... he isn't feeling well!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:33.790
He doesn't
usually say things like this!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:38.670
He usually says a little, but I
really don't know what he's thinking.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.380
Anyway, we're very sorry!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.010
- Right? Apologize, Akito-kun.
- No.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.050
Hayama, you brat!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.770
Forgive him...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.890
A waste of my effort...

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.600
I hoped you'd keep the peace...

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.190
I hoped you wouldn't cause
problems...

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:04.990
I was trying so hard...
I can't take it anymore!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.700
Akito-kun, you idiot!!!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.240
I'm gonna destroy you!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.830
Hayama, destruction of
public property.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.370
Hayama-kun is really scary.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.460
True, but also cool.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.590
Cool?

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.300
Yeah! Cool!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.800
Are you mesmerized by Hayama?

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.800
I so adore him!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.050
Wow!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.470
- Here...
- Thank you, lady.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.720
Have you decided? I'm gonna
participate in the gymnastics club.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.510
Yeah! Gymnastics!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.100
Thanks, lady!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.770
My gymnastics isn't bad.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.650
I'm very confident on how
flexible I am.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:45.280
- Ok, we can join together!
- Yeah, together!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.240
Are you two okay?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.360
Yeah. Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.200
I won't be in any clubs.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.910
I have to take care of my little
sister and I have stuff to do at home.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.660
That's really nice of you.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.750
Akito-kun won't be in any clubs
either because he has karate.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:04.130
You're here... eating curry and acting
like you're stupid.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.920
Seeing Aki, I remember something
else that makes me mad.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:07.840
What is it?

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.880
Thinking of something seeing curry

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:10.760
Aside from Indian curry,
there's all kinds of curry.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.720
There were these gold and silver
paints that I really treasured.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.770
These gold and silver paints...

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:21.060
...I didn't use them and I packed
them very carefully...

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.110
He took it and drew gold and silver
colored Auku.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.230
Auku?

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.490
Yes, yes, sorry everyone.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:31.660
Auku... hmm... auku...?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.530
I don't know what this is.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:36.910
Let's hear Auku backwards!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:41.250
Auku! Shit! Shit! Shit!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:44.170
Don't read what other people wrote
backwards!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.500
You're wrong.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.920
What do you mean?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.420
Ice cream.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.010
I'll get you!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.680
That hurts! That hurts!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.930
Don't yell in the cafeteria.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:58.770
Even I, the peacemaker,
will get into trouble.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.890
Wait, we'll get black listed by
the teachers!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.020
Well, what do you want me to do
about it?

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:08.400
You keep bringing up these things
that are way in the past.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.450
What if I buy you some gold and
silver paints? Is that what you want?

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.740
Don't say it like it doesn't mean
anything.

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.030
Listen, Hayama Aki!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.910
My broken heart is still crying!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:23.080
The scars on women's hearts are
the enemies of women.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.750
You remember that!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.510
Fuka, can I ask you something?

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:30.590
What?

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:35.220
If he really likes you, wouldn't
Takaishi-kun forgive you?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.550
Call him, Fuka!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.970
I called him.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.640
I see.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:42.890
But he already has another girl
that he likes.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.490
It's too late.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.950
I'm sorry, I've said too much,
I'm sorry.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:01.040
But Takaishi-kun and I...
we really got along well.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.830
He said he liked me.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.620
I'm sorry, Fuka.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.250
But I don't like being unhappy!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.340
You ok?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.670
Uh... yeah... I'm alright.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.430
No matter what, I'll make Hayama
pay even more!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.390
I'm gonna forget him!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.930
That's right!
That's what you should do!

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.310
Yeah! That's what I'll do.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.100
Alright, Fuka!
Start doing exercises!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.850
Eh? What for?

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.190
Don't you wanna be in
the gymnastics club?

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:31.190
Do you know how to exercise?
Fine. My god.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.490
Lift your arm, use your muscles
from your back.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.490
Feels good.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:43.450
Sana-chan is doing
the old ladies' exercise!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.960
His nose bleeds everywhere.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.880
I screwed up my commentary again.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:52.210
Press conference! Press conference!
Can you hear me?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.880
I heard you! I heard you!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.010
Not good, I'm late for my press conference!
I can't miss this meeting!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.050
You wasted time exercising!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:02.180
- Hurry up!
- Run faster! What'll we do?

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.810
This way!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.070
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.320
Hey, hey, hey...

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.030
Familiar faces!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.240
Hey, Sana-chan! Long time no see!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.410
Asako-san too... good to see you!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.830
Asako-san and Rei-kun seem
to be hiding the fact that they're going out.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.660
They are acknowledging each other secretly.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:30.000
The script will be done in three days.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.130
The script isn't done yet,
hope it'll be ok.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.090
If it's not ready, we'll ad-lib!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.880
Sana-chan,
this isn't a variety show.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.550
That's true!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.810
Asako-san, I didn't know you
were going to be in this movie.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.810
They only decided to cast me five days ago.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.150
Even Rei didn't know this.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:55.690
But I'm really happy to be able to
act with you.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.490
Yeah, it's been a long time since I saw you.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:18:59.950
I'm surprised.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.320
Why?

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.280
You grew up.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.700
I was surprised to hear that
you were in middle school already.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.620
Eh? So I didn't change?

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.830
That's not it, but you grew up.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.120
Really?

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.500
Growing up
is natural for most humans!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.590
Hmm... I didn't know
Sana-chan grew taller.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.640
It's probably because I see her
every day.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.050
Really?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.850
So you won't come to school once
you start shooting on location?

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.900
When I'm not here, don't cry.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.150
What do you mean?

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:38.280
When I'm sad, I'm just gonna
go to Aki and beat him up!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.200
I gotcha! I gotcha!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.330
You only realized
it after you split up?

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.540
Yeah, I've always been together
with him. What's changed?

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.170
He's different from kindergarten.
Also, we weren't in the same...

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.920
elementary school, so when I saw
him again I thought he was someone else.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:00.260
Once I talked to him,
I realized he was still like him.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.010
The same annoying Aki as before.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.550
Yeah?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.100
Please?

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:10.640
Um...
because this girl is your fan...

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.100
...she wants to take a picture
with you...

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.400
Is that okay?

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.730
I'm sorry.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.480
Eh, why not? What harm is there in
one picture?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.900
She's really liked you ever
since school started.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.870
I don't know what's going on
but this is scary.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.160
Just looking at him, you wouldn't
think he's such a girl-magnet.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.410
Yes, yes.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.330
Eh? Eh?

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:35.380
Hayama is scary? Scary? Why?

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:36.590
Hmm? What's up?

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:41.130
But when he was in elementary school, girls did hate him as if he was a hairy caterpillar!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:47.010
Hairy caterpillar Hayama

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:45.090
Sana was Hayama being scary!
Gives you goose bumps!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.680
- Please... just one photo?
- No.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.230
It'll be done fast.
Just stand next to each other.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:56.350
I don't even know this girl and to
think she will have a picture of her and me...

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.810
...disgusts me.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.110
What...

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:01.360
Te-chan, forget about it.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.070
What's wrong with you!
You're the worst!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.110
Forget this kind of guy!

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.530
Jerk!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.450
Who does he think he is?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.120
Even though his look and his smile
seem mean...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.420
...I thought
he had become nicer to me.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.590
Hey! Hayama Aki!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.430
If you're gonna refuse,
why can't you be a little nicer?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:28.220
That poor girl is crying!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.970
Hold it!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:32.600
You should answer when someone
asks you something!

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.690
She's the one who approached me
without knowing me. It's her own fault.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:39.190
She's rude-she's the one who
didn't even introduce herself.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:43.900
Hmm... you have a point.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.450
Even so, you still didn't have to
ignore her like this.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:48.620
Shut up!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:52.370
If I'm nice to someone I don't like,
I don't feel that's truly being nice.

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:59.710
You have a point there too.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:01.340
Let go of me.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:07.840
What was that look just now?

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:09.470
He...

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:13.060
...with his looks, he's not just
another annoying guy.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:15.980
That Hayama.
He makes a lot of sense.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.480
He's cool and interesting.

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:27.360
Cool? Interesting?

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:34.910
These kinds of things, I've never
